    "text": "AZFamily\nwebsite\nScottsdale\nScottsdale Unified bans crop-tops; some parents says it unfairly targets girls\nBy Sarah Robinson,\n3 hours agoSCOTTSDALE, AZ (AZFamily) — A new dress code policy in the Scottsdale Unified School District is sparking controversy. Some parents in the district are upset about what it bans and who it applies to. Students must now wear tops that fully cover the stomach; crop tops are not allowed.\n5",
